# LeakSanitizer suppressions for nightly-leaks.yml. Every entry names a
# function that exists in sdk/ or tests/ (tools/check_lsan_supp.py, run in
# per-commit lint); an entry whose function is renamed or deleted fails there.

# tests/functional/rocketnet_functional_tests.cpp: rocketnet_test_server_uring_create_stalled
# is the one noinline frame that creates the transport the probe deliberately
# stalls destroying, so this suppresses only that transport's abandoned memory,
# not every allocation made anywhere under the probe.
leak:rocketnet_test_server_uring_create_stalled
